<title>HUNGARY: Styl reports lower Jan-Sept profits.</title>
<headline>Styl reports lower Jan-Sept profits.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine-month period ending Sept 30, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of forints unless stated)</p>
<p>					  Jan-Sept 96  vs   Jan-Sept 95</p>
<p>    Operating profit		  311.2	vs     402.0</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit		    212.0	vs     254.7</p>
<p>    After-tax profit		  165.3	vs     179.1</p>
<p>    Net sales revenue	     2,191.5	vs   2,137.3</p>
<p>     Net domestic sales	     492.1	vs     396.4</p>
<p>     Net export sales	     1,699.4	vs   1,740.9</p>
<p>    Other revenue			50.6	vs	48.5</p>
<p>    Direct costs of sales	   939.1	vs     967.8</p>
<p>    Indirect costs of sales	 866.0	vs     668.7</p>
<p>    Other expenditures		125.8	vs     147.4</p>
<p>    Net financial income	    103.3 loss vs     146.4 loss</p>
<p>     Financial revenue		109.3	vs	79.3</p>
<p>     Financial expenditure	  212.6	vs     225.8</p>
<p>    Net extraordinary income	  4.2 profit vs     0.8 loss</p>
<p>     Extraordinary revenue	    4.8	vs	 0.1</p>
<p>     Extraordinary expenditure	0.6	vs	 1.0</p>
<p>    Taxation			     46.8	vs	75.6</p>
<p>NOTE - Styl Ruhagyar Rt is a manufacturer of clothing.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom (36 1) 327-4040</p>
</text>
